    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d428">

                <pb facs="0503" n="429" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg429"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/8929</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-02-18">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 18, 1918</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received February 21, 4 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2385. Germany notifies that armistice terminate noon to-day when state of war be
                    resumed, to which reply made that same incredible because seven days’ notice
                    required. Later, just heard Germans have taken Revel and Dvinsk.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
